**/obj/
publish/
*.user
TestResults/

# Working notes that are not part of the product: the phase plan the project was built
# against, the verification log, the decision record and the design exploration. They are kept
# on the machine; the repository carries the documentation of what the project is now.
docs/internal/

# Editor state. Rider and the other JetBrains IDEs write this beside the solution; VS Code
# and Visual Studio are already covered by the two lines above.
.idea/
.vs/

# What a Development run leaves in the project directory: the service creates its data
# directory beside the binary when no --data-dir is given.
logs/
windows-control-service.db
windows-control-service.db-shm
windows-control-service.db-wal

# The generator writes this next to the picture it screenshots.
banner/banner.html
